Kirru as "Shell-carver" [neutral]: The name goes on the inside. Against the throat. You hear it with your skin. #line:ch10_bark_carver_001
<<if $ch10_heard_ressa>>
    Kirru as "Shell-carver" [sad]: I scraped one blank, the spring before last. I was asked to. My hands remember it. #line:ch10_bark_carver_002
<<endif>>
